**Best practices:**
- Use `rem` for font sizes (accessibility, user can adjust)
- Use `em` for component-relative spacing
- Use `px` for borders and small details
- Use `vw/vh` for full-screen layouts
- Use `%` for fluid grid layouts
- Use `ch` for text column width
- Avoid `pt`, `cm`, `in` for screen (use for print CSS only)

```css
/* The CSS Box Model - every element is a rectangular box */

/* Default box model (content-box) - width/height only includes content */
.content-box {
    box-sizing: content-box;  /* default */
    width: 300px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 5px solid black;
    margin: 10px;
    /* Total width = 300 + 40 + 10 = 350px */
}

/* Border-box model - width/height includes content + padding + border */
.border-box {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 300px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 5px solid black;
    margin: 10px;
    /* Total width = 300px (padding and border inside) */
}

/* Universal reset (recommended) */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

/* Box model components demonstration */
.box-model-demo {
    /* Content area */
    width: 200px;
    height: 150px;

    /* Padding (space between content and border) */
    padding-top: 10px;
    padding-right: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    /* Shorthand: padding: 10px 20px 10px 20px; (top right bottom left) */
    /* Or: padding: 10px 20px; (top/bottom left/right) */

    /* Border */
    border-width: 2px;
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: #333;
    /* Shorthand: border: 2px solid #333; */

    /* Border radius (rounded corners) */
    border-radius: 8px;

    /* Margin (space outside border) */
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-right: auto;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    margin-left: auto;
    /* Shorthand: margin: 20px auto; */

    /* Background extends into padding but not margin */
    background-color: lightblue;
}

/* Margin collapsing example */
.margin-collapse {
    /* When two vertical margins meet, the larger one wins */
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.next-element {
    margin-top: 30px;
    /* Gap between = 30px (not 50px) */
}

/* Box shadow (adds depth outside element) */
.with-shadow {
    box-shadow: 5px 5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    /* horizontal offset, vertical offset, blur, color */
}

/* Outline (similar to border but doesn't affect layout) */
.focus-outline:focus {
    outline: 3px solid blue;
    /* Doesn't change box model dimensions */
}
```

