**Comparison table:**

| Display | New line | Width/Height | Margin/Padding | Default width |
|---------|----------|--------------|----------------|---------------|
| block | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | 100% |
| inline | ✗ | ✗ (no) | partial (horizontal) | content |
| inline-block | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ | content |
| flex | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | 100% |
| none | - | - | - | not rendered |

**Common use cases:**
- `block`: main layout containers
- `inline`: text styling, links within paragraphs
- `inline-block`: navigation menus, button groups
- `flex`: modern layouts, centering, responsive designs
- `none`: hide elements conditionally

