**Properties that CAN be transitioned:**
- Colors (color, background-color, border-color, outline-color)
- Box model (width, height, padding, margin, border-width)
- Positioning (top, right, bottom, left)
- Transform (translate, scale, rotate, skew)
- Opacity
- Visibility
- z-index
- letter-spacing, word-spacing
- text-shadow, box-shadow
- filter

**Properties that CANNOT be transitioned:**
- display (use opacity + visibility instead)
- font-family
- image sources
- position (static to fixed jumps)

**Best Practices:**
- Use `transform` for animations (hardware accelerated)
- Avoid transitioning `width`/`height` (causes layout reflow)
- Use `opacity` + `transform` for smooth animations
- Prefer `all` for simple transitions, but be specific for performance
- Add `will-change: transform` for smoother animations
